{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46170","headline":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 四 · 贯休","name":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魄慑魂飞骨亦销，此魂此魄亦难招。\n黄今白玉家家尽，绣闼雕甍处处烧。\n惊动乾坤常黯惨，深藏山岳亦倾摇。\n恭闻国有英雄将，拟把何心荅圣朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}